      "text": "Slingshot 需要聚类标签来定义起始簇和分支结构，这是推断轨迹的必要输入。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 需要降维后的坐标（如 PCA 或 UMAP）来拟合最小生成树和同时主曲线。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "归一化表达矩阵用于沿轨迹拟合平滑曲线和估计 pseudotime，是 Slingshot 的必要输入。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 cluster_labels、normalized_expression 和 reduced_dimensions 均存在，因此从输入条件看可以开始 Slingshot 分析。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:cluster_labels", "user:normalized_expression", "user:reduced_dimensions"]
    },
    {
      "text": "推荐提供起始簇或根簇信息，否则 Slingshot 会默认选择起始簇，可能不符合生物学预期。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "推荐检查聚类标签与降维坐标是否来自同一组细胞且顺序一致，否则轨迹推断会错配。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
